---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
const recent=(await getCollection('blog',({data})=>!data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>+b.data.published-+a.data.published).slice(0,3);
const works=[{number:'01',kind:'AI PRODUCT · TEAM',title:'AI-Newsroom OS',desc:'기사 작성부터 검증, 변환, 아카이빙까지. 흩어진 기자의 업무를 하나의 흐름으로.',url:'/portfolio#newsroom'},{number:'02',kind:'DATA PLATFORM · INDEPENDENT',title:'Art City Intelligence',desc:'도시의 문화 생태계를 비교하는 데이터 기반 인터랙티브 플랫폼.',url:'/portfolio#art-city'},{number:'03',kind:'AI AGENT · R&D',title:'NewTeams',desc:'상황에 따라 단일 에이전트와 전문 에이전트 팀을 전환하는 작업 플랫폼.',url:'/portfolio#newteams'}];
---
<Base><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="orange-marker"></span> INDEPENDENT MAKER · SEOUL, KR</div><h1>Between <em>art</em><br/>and <em>systems.</em></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>시각적 사고와 기술적 구현 사이에서<br/>새로운 연결을 탐색합니다.</p><span class="hero-scroll">SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div><div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit-ring"></div><div class="orbit-ring second"></div><div class="orbit-core"></div></div></section><div class="marquee"><span>ART / TECHNOLOGY / SPACE / WRITING / CREATIVE SYSTEMS / ART / TECHNOLOGY / SPACE / WRITING / CREATIVE SYSTEMS /</span></div><section class="section work-section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-overline">01 / SELECTED WORK</div><h2>Things I've <i>built.</i></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/portfolio">ALL PROJECTS ↗</a></div><div class="work-list">{works.map(w=><a class="work-item" href={w.url}><span class="work-no">{w.number}</span><div class="work-meta"><span class="work-kind">{w.kind}</span><h3>{w.title}</h3><p>{w.desc}</p></div><span class="work-arrow">↗</span></a>)}</div></section><section class="statement"><span class="section-overline">POINT OF VIEW</span><p>좋은 아이디어는 영역의 경계를<br/>넘나들 때 더 선명해진다고 믿습니다<span class="accent-dot">.</span></p><div class="statement-foot">THINK IN CONTEXT. BUILD WITH PURPOSE.</div></section><section class="section journal-section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-overline">02 / THE JOURNAL</div><h2>Notes & <i>observations.</i></h2></div><a href="/blog" class="text-link">ALL WRITING ↗</a></div><div class="blog-grid">{recent.map(post=><a class="post-card" href={'/blog/'+post.id+'/'}><span class="post-card-label">{post.data.category}</span><div class="post-visual"><span class="post-symbol">↗</span></div><time>{post.data.published.toISOString().slice(0,10)}</time><h3>{post.data.title}</h3><p>{post.data.description}</p><span class="read-more">READ ARTICLE ↗</span></a>)}</div></section><section class="contact-section"><div class="section-overline">03 / LET'S CONNECT</div><h2>Have an idea?<br/><i>Let's make it real.</i></h2><a href="mailto:beang66@gmail.com" class="contact-link">GET IN TOUCH <span>↗</span></a></section></Base>